  "notes": "v0.34 foot_stems (docs/foot_stems.md): source 'jump_land', rebuilt from stems of a CC0 recording (THIRD_PARTY.md). A single real step (or landing) by default, softer than the often-forceful recording. The seed macro (or any variation) remixes the real stems; nothing is averaged, bands are not pitch-shifted (size is tape speed), and there is no freeze, time-squeeze or added smoothing. count plays a short run of real steps; tempo changes their spacing."
